      "role": "user",
      "content": "I just finished the final movement. It’s done. Everything I ever wanted to say, every note I could possibly conceive... it's all on the page now. I look at the horizon and I don't see more music, I just see the slow, quiet fade of becoming obsolete. It feels like the performance is over, and there's nothing left to do but sit in the dark and wait for the lights to go out.",
